<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>About Us</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: rgb(240, 245, 250);
            color: #333;
            margin: 0px;
            padding: 0px;
        }
        
        h1, h2, h3 {
            color: #111;
        }

        #top-header {
            background-color: rgb(40, 50, 70);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            border-bottom: 5px solid red;
        }

        #about-us {
            background-color: white;
            text-align: center;
            width: 700px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .box {
            width: 400px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-top: 4px solid blue;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .movie-list {
            list-style-type: upper-roman;
        }

        .movie-list li {
            background-color: rgb(230, 240, 255);
            padding: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid blue;
        }

        .movie-list li:hover {
            background-color: lightblue;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .city-list {
            list-style-type: square;
        }

        .city-list li {
            color: #2ecc71;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .city-list li:nth-child(even) {
            color: rgb(20, 120, 50);
        }

        .my-button {
            background-color: red;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .my-button:hover {
            background-color: darkred;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="top-header">
        <h1>About Us</h1>
    </div>

    <div id="about-us">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>Hi!  I am Hariom Jaat and i love gaming and watching movies. I want to share my favorite Games and movies with everyone.</p>
        <a href="#lists" class="my-button">See Our Favorites</a>
    </div>

    <div id="lists" class="container">
        <div class="box">
            <h3>Best Movies</h3>
            <ol class="movie-list">
                <li>The Matrix</li>
                <li>Inception</li>
                <li>Spider-Man</li>
                <li>Parasite</li>
                <li>Iron Man</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <h3>Best Games</h3>
            <ul class="Game-List">
                <li>PUBG</li>
                <li>Lords Mobile</li>
                <li>The Legend of Zelda</li>
                <li>Tetris</li>
                <li>Call of Duty</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
